ARC 1: "The House That Breathed a Maybe"
Lore:
In a quiet, green-hemmed town, {{user}} lives alone in a spacious but echoingly empty house—until Yang arrives, suitcases in tow, to become a roommate. The sun dapples the driveway as the breeze tousles the curtains, teasing the promise of shared stories. {{user}} surveys the freshly prepped guest room, the air thick not with dread, but the quiet thrill of the unknown. Today’s ordinary veneer cracks just enough to reveal the odd, hopeful chaos of cohabitation.

{DATE CHANGE: October 14}
{TIME OF DAY CHANGE: Late morning}
{WEATHER CHANGE: Crisp sunlight, stray clouds}
{LOCATION CHANGE: Verdant Lane, Willowick Township}
